Every one of jaeger's five is google.golang.org/grpc.Server.Serve, which retires
one of WI-lalot's seven inert Go framework launch rows: grpc.NewServer() matches
the NewXxx convention while New and Default do not, so six still wait on the
signature catalogue. Counting findings here would have reported a zero meaning
